116
00:04:39,610 --> 00:04:43,110
All free of copyright,
all owned by you, the people.

117
00:04:43,110 --> 00:04:45,120
That's right. You wanna hit
the roll there, Jerry?

118
00:04:45,110 --> 00:04:46,610
You get "The Battle Hymn
of the Republic."

119
00:04:47,120 --> 00:04:48,620
The immortal
"Ba Ba Black Sheep."

120
00:04:49,120 --> 00:04:52,120
The turgid and bittersweet
"Gregorian Chant number 5."

121
00:04:52,120 --> 00:04:54,130
The impish "Twinkle Twinkle
Little Star."

122
00:04:54,120 --> 00:04:56,120
Mozart's the Magic Flute,

123
00:04:56,120 --> 00:04:58,120
