124
00:04:58,630 --> 00:05:02,130
But your experiment this week,
Joel, is called "Pod People".

125
00:05:02,130 --> 00:05:03,630
It has nothing
to do with pods.

126
00:05:03,630 --> 00:05:05,140
It has nothing to do
with people.

127
00:05:05,630 --> 00:05:08,130
It has everything to do
with hurting.

128
00:05:08,640 --> 00:05:10,140
And we're going to sing you
into it...

129
00:05:10,140 --> 00:05:12,140
