karaoke machine.

130
00:05:12,140 --> 00:05:13,140
Hit it, Frank.

131
00:05:13,640 --> 00:05:17,650
Ave

132
00:05:17,650 --> 00:05:21,150
Maria

133
00:05:22,150 --> 00:05:25,160
